config SND_SOC_DVF99_CSS
	tristate "DSPG DVF99 cordless subsystem PCM support"
	depends on ARCH_DSPG || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on RPMSG_DVF99_DUA && HAS_DMA
	help
	  Say Y or M to play and record audio through the firmware of the
	  cordless subsystem of the DSP Group DVF99 SoC. The PCM data goes
	  over its "alsa" coma channel. The driver provides seven PCM
	  devices, one for each stream that the firmware offers, and sets
	  up the DSP units of the audio path through the DSP unit API.
